[09-Aug-2025 15:26:21 Europe/Zurich] getTarifs called with serviceId: , uniteId: , typeTarifId: , date: 2025-08-09
[09-Aug-2025 15:26:21 Europe/Zurich] SQL Tarifs: SELECT t.id, t.service_id, t.unite_id, t.type_tarif_id, t.prix, t.date_debut, t.date_fin,
                    s.code as service_code, s.nom as service_nom,
                    u.code as unite_code, u.nom as unite_nom,
                    tt.code as type_tarif_code, tt.nom as type_tarif_nom
                    FROM tarifs t
                    JOIN services s ON t.service_id = s.id
                    JOIN unites u ON t.unite_id = u.id
                    JOIN types_tarifs tt ON t.type_tarif_id = tt.id
                    WHERE 1=1 AND (t.date_debut <= ? AND (t.date_fin IS NULL OR t.date_fin >= ?)) ORDER BY s.nom, u.nom, tt.nom, t.date_debut DESC
